# DevOps & Deployment Rules - Greek ERP/CRM System

## Deployment Strategies

- **Canary Deployment**: Core platform with customer-tier rollout (5% → 20% → 80% → 100%)
- **Blue/Green**: Critical services (AADE, payments, authentication) for zero downtime
- **Feature Flags**: Multi-level control (global, tier-based, customer-specific, user-specific)
- **Rolling Updates**: Support platform microservices with batched updates
- **Customer-Specific**: Enterprise custom implementations with dedicated staging

## Infrastructure Standards

- **Monorepo Architecture**: Shared packages, standard modules, customer-specific apps
- **Containerization**: Docker containers for all services and applications
- **Orchestration**: Kubernetes for container management and scaling
- **Database Architecture**: Separate PostgreSQL database per company with smart resource pooling
- **Load Balancing**: Proper traffic distribution and health checks
- **Service Mesh**: Inter-service communication and security

## Database Infrastructure Management

- **Company Database Provisioning**: Automated database creation with full schema and Greek data seeding
- **Resource Pooling**: Small companies on shared instances, large companies on dedicated instances
- **Auto-scaling**: Dynamic migration between shared and dedicated database instances
- **Migration Orchestration**: Parallel migration execution across all company databases
- **Connection Management**: Company-specific connection pools and routing

## Environment Management

- **Development**: Local development with Docker Compose and sample company databases
- **Staging**: Production-like environment with representative company database distribution
- **Production**: Multi-region deployment with database clustering
- **Customer Staging**: Dedicated environments for enterprise customers with full database isolation
- **Desktop**: Local SQLite with cloud synchronization

## CI/CD Pipeline Requirements

- **Automated Testing**: All tests must pass including multi-database scenarios
- **Database Migration Testing**: Verify migrations across multiple company databases
- **Code Quality**: Linting, security scanning, dependency checks
- **Build Process**: Optimized builds for each deployment target
- **Rollback Capability**: Quick rollback mechanisms for all deployment types
- **Greek Compliance**: AADE integration testing in pipeline

## Comprehensive Backup Strategy

- **Multi-Level Backups**: Continuous WAL (30s), daily full (3AM), weekly cross-region, monthly archive
- **Company-Specific Backups**: Individual backup schedules and retention per company
- **Parallel Backup Execution**: Automated backup orchestration across hundreds of company databases
- **Encrypted Storage**: Company-specific encryption keys for all backup data
- **Point-in-Time Recovery**: WAL-based recovery for any timestamp per company
- **Greek Legal Compliance**: 5+ year retention meeting Greek regulatory requirements

## Monitoring & Observability

- **Response Times**: <200ms for simple operations, <2s for complex
- **Error Rates**: Monitor and alert on error rate increases per company
- **Database Performance**: Per-company database metrics and alerting
- **AADE Integration**: >99% success rate for Greek tax submissions
- **Uptime Targets**: 99.9% core platform, 99.95% AADE, 99.99% payments
- **Resource Utilization**: Track database resource usage for auto-scaling decisions

## Performance Requirements

- **Deployment Speed**: Feature flags <1s, traffic routing <5min, blue/green <30s
- **Database Operations**: Company provisioning <10min, migration across all DBs <60min
- **Rollback Speed**: Feature flags <1s, traffic routing <2min, full environment <60min
- **Backup Performance**: Daily backups complete within 4-hour window
- **Zero Downtime**: Critical services must maintain availability during deployments

## Security Standards

- **Container Security**: Scan images for vulnerabilities before deployment
- **Database Isolation**: Complete separation between company databases
- **Secrets Management**: Secure storage and rotation of credentials and API keys
- **Network Security**: VPC isolation for company database clusters
- **Access Control**: Role-based access to deployment systems and environments
- **Audit Logging**: Complete deployment and database operation audit trails

## Greek Compliance Deployment

- **AADE Testing**: Mandatory testing against AADE sandbox before production
- **Tax Validation**: Verify AFM/DOY validation in all environments
- **Data Protection**: Ensure GDPR compliance in all deployed versions
- **Greek Character Sets**: Test proper handling of Greek text in all services
- **Business Rules**: Validate Greek VAT calculations and business logic
- **Historical Data Access**: Verify multi-year reporting capabilities via partitioned tables

## Backup & Recovery Operations

- **Automated Orchestration**: Daily backup execution across all company databases
- **Cross-Region Replication**: Geographically distributed backup storage
- **Recovery Testing**: Regular disaster recovery testing per company
- **Data Retention**: Automated lifecycle management for Greek data retention requirements
- **Backup Verification**: Automated integrity checks for all backup files
- **Company-Specific Restore**: Individual company database restoration capabilities

## Database Lifecycle Management

- **Company Onboarding**: Automated database provisioning with Greek reference data
- **Resource Optimization**: Monitor usage patterns and optimize database resource allocation
- **Archive Management**: Automated data archiving based on access patterns and legal requirements
- **Performance Tuning**: Automated partition management and query optimization
- **Decommissioning**: Secure data deletion and backup retention for closed companies

## Customer-Specific Deployments

- **Enterprise Staging**: Exact production replica with dedicated company database
- **Custom Modules**: Isolated deployment of customer-specific features
- **Acceptance Testing**: Customer approval process before production deployment
- **Scheduled Deployment**: Customer-controlled deployment windows
- **Individual Rollback**: Customer-specific rollback capabilities with database restore

## Desktop Application Deployment

- **Auto-Update**: Background download with user-scheduled installation
- **Offline Capability**: Ensure functionality during connectivity issues
- **Local Database**: Safe SQLite migration with backup and recovery
- **Cloud Sync**: Optional synchronization with company's cloud database
- **License Validation**: Secure license checking and enforcement
- **Version Control**: Coordinated updates with cloud platform

## What NOT to Do

- ❌ Never deploy without testing across multiple company databases
- ❌ Don't skip backup verification and restoration testing
- ❌ Never deploy during Greek business hours without approval
- ❌ Don't ignore company-specific database performance metrics
- ❌ Never skip security scanning and vulnerability checks
- ❌ Don't deploy without proper database connection routing verification
- ❌ Never bypass CI/CD pipeline for production deployments
- ❌ Don't forget to test partition pruning and historical data access
- ❌ Never skip Greek compliance testing including AADE integration
- ❌ Don't ignore automated backup failure alerts
- ❌ Never bypass CI/CD pipeline for production deployments
- ❌ Don't forget to test Greek character handling
